==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*koliko}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kolǐko/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|ko|li|ko|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=kolìko}}

# {{lb|sh|interrogative}} [[how much]], [[how many]]
#: {{ux|sh|'''Koliko''' imaš vremena?|How much time do you have?|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''Koliko''' je sati?|What time is it?|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''Koliko''' puta?|How many times?|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''Koliko''' dugo?|(For) How long?|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|in comparisons|formal|preceded by {{m|sh|onoliko}}}}  [[as]], as much/many as
#: {{ux|sh|Kupite onoliko igračaka '''koliko''' je djece.|Buy as many toys as there are children.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|On je skoro onoliko visok '''koliko''' i ja.|He is almost as tall as I am.|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|with generalization particle {{m|sh|god}}}} no matter how much/how many
#: {{ux|sh|'''Koliko god''' mu daš, nikad nije dosta!|No matter how much you give him, it's never enough!|inline=1}}


====Related terms====  
* {{l|sh|količina}}
